planation":"Connect every conclusion to the applicable function representation, symbolic relationship, or contextual assumption.","minimum_fix":"Repair the earliest missing setup, representation, or justification needed for the next unearned criterion.","transfer_candidate":"Create a new function-concepts FRQ for Topic 2.11 with a different function family, data structure, and context.","delayed_retrieval_candidate":"Reassess Topic 2.11 later with no shared wording, values, or scenario.","known_boundary_cases":["Award each one-point criterion independently.","Carry-forward arithmetic may earn later reasoning credit when the method remains valid.","Do not award a modeling limitation for a generic statement unrelated to the given context."],"originality_statement":"Independently authored Cramapple practice item from a blank scope brief; no released, secure, or third-party question or scoring language was used."},"provenance":{"source_refs":["ap-precalculus-ced-effective-fall-2026"],"fact_pack_version":"2026-07-28","authoring_prompt_version":"CODEX_PRECALCULUS_DIFFICULTY_QA_2026_07_28","generated_by":"codex","generated_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","content_sha256":"e45757d534aa47157feac9e5ff1ea15103436ff438dbf473385d69c3fb3d594a"}},{"schema_version":"1.0.0","package_id":"apprecalc-frq-022","content_key":"apprecalc-frq-022","content_version":1,"difficulty":"Easy","exam_pack_ref":{"exam_code":"ap_precalculus","school_year":"2026-27","exam_pack_version":"1.0.0"},"item_type":"frq","archetype_ref":{"archetype_key":"ap-precalculus-frq-modeling-nonperiodic","version":"1.0.0"},"taxonomy_refs":[{"scheme_key":"ap-precalculus-2026-27","scheme_version":"1.0.0","node_key":"unit-1-polynomial-and-rational-functions"},{"scheme_key":"ap-precalculus-2026-27","scheme_version":"1.0.0","node_key":"topic-1.14"},{"scheme_key":"ap-precalculus-2026-27","scheme_version":"1.0.0","node_key":"practice-3"}],"frq_form":"long","canonical_answers":["The system is c=2, 4a+2b+c=10, and 25a+5b+c=7. | Solving gives y=−t²+6t+2. | The average rate is [y(4)−y(1)]/3=(10−7)/3=1 meter per second. | Interprets the value as average vertical change over the interval. | The prediction is an extrapolation far beyond the measured times and may be physically impossible. | Connects the limitation to the data interval or ground impact."],"stimuli":[{"stimulus_key":"scenario","ordinal":1,"kind":"text","payload":{"text":"A ball’s height y, in meters, is modeled as a quadratic function of time t, in seconds. Measurements give (t,y)=(0,2),(2,10),(5,7).","calculator_mode":"calculator"},"source_refs":["ap-precalculus-ced-effective-fall-2026"]}],"parts":[{"part_key":"part-a","ordinal":1,"label":"(a)","prompt":"Construct the quadratic model y=at²+bt+c by giving a system and solving for a, b, and c.","stimulus_refs":["scenario"],"response_modalities":["typed-text","typed-math"],"points":2,"criteria":[{"criterion_key":"part-a-criterion-1","points":1,"description":"The system is c=2, 4a+2b+c=10, and 25a+5b+c=7.","required_evidence":["The system is c=2, 4a+2b+c=10, and 25a+5b+c=7."],"accepted_variants":["Any mathematically equivalent response with the required setup, interpretation, or justification."],"insufficient_responses":["A bare answer when the criterion requires construction, supporting work, contextual interpretation, domain restrictions, or model limitations."],"contradictions":["Do not award when the response directly contradicts the required function behavior, domain, units, representation, or contextual conclusion."],"minimum_fix":"Add or correct the evidence needed to establish: The system is c=2, 4a+2b+c=10, and 25a+5b+c=7.","deterministic_checks":[{"check_type":"criterion-points","parameters":{"expected_points":1}}]},{"criterion_key":"part-a-criterion-2","points":1,"description":"Solving gives y=−t²+6t+2.","required_evidence":["Solving gives y=−t²+6t+2."],"accepted_variants":["Any mathematically equivalent response with the required setup, interpretation, or justification."],"in